Package: com.soum91.daybreak.tweak
Name: Daybreak (Dopamine)
Version: 0.2.8
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Automatic daily calendar wake planning with guarded native Apple Sleep one-day overrides for iOS 16 Dopamine. Sleep service access and Watch sync must be verified on-device.
Maintainer: soum91
Author: soum91
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0), firmware (<< 17.0), mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Conflicts: com.soum91.daybreak.rootful
Homepage: https://github.com/soum91/daybreak
